HDR display (Operator Setup → Display) brightens live view, scopes, settings, media and playback on the phone panel. Off by default; not the camera's HDR/HLG color mode. Judge exposure from WAVE/HISTO, not picture brightness. Screen recording uses a normal SDR picture. Saved settings, remembered cameras and resized pictures go through one shared path. Also fixes a start-up failure on Android 15 and newer.
